Lewica invites Kaczyński's economic team and Morawiecki's association to the
same public roundtable on investment and industrial policy. Rozwój+ gains the
visibility of a separate voice, but the minutes still identify every one of
its deputies as PiS. Both camps keep our telephone number; neither receives
recognition of a split that has not happened.

- @poland_event_queue: Convene the roundtable

@rozwoj_association_attack
