At the first press conference, Lewica answers the new logo with Morawiecki's
years as prime minister: the Polish Deal's disruption, centralised investment
and promises made without organised labour. Rozwój+ is forced to defend a
record it hoped to inherit selectively. The attack hardens its separate
identity even as it denies the rebrand a clean beginning.

- @poland_event_queue: Hold the press conference

@rozwoj_association_social
