Lewica offers a joint package coupling regional investment to collective
bargaining and labour inspection. Morawiecki claims that Rozwój+ changed policy
without leaving PiS, exactly the proof he needs to postpone a rupture. Workers
gain an advocate across the aisle; our progressive wing asks why a former PiS
prime minister was allowed to present a Left condition as his achievement.

- @poland_event_queue: Table the joint package

