A rota of MPs, trade-union economists and local organisers begins passing
through the studio with the same briefing book and a rapid-response team behind
it. Kanał Zero gains credible adversaries and more reach; Lewica gains the less
glamorous habit of surviving a hostile interview without letting one guest
invent the party line.

- @poland_event_queue: Send the first guest

@zero_build_2026
title: Answer television with a federated Left media network
subtitle: Put union, local and creator outlets on a shared distribution system without making them a central party channel. Cost: 3 resources.
