Before the presidential ink can dry, Kotula files a marriage-equality bill and
calls the partnership statute the first protection won, not the final status
owed. Kosiniak-Kamysz accuses Lewica of turning a negotiated settlement into a
trap. The far right seizes on the new text, but nobody can now sell the limited
bill as the end of the argument.

- @poland_event_queue: File the marriage bill

