Local organisers pair every abstention with the hospital visit, tenancy or
inheritance case the bill would have covered. Deputies who expected the vote to
vanish into a Warsaw ledger meet it again at constituency surgeries. The bill
is still defeated; what changes is the price of forgetting how each member
voted.

