= The promise comes back to the chamber

After the earlier defeat or veto, <span class="party-psl"><b>Władysław Kosiniak-Kamysz</b></span> promised a dated
return for hospital access, tenancy and inheritance. <span class="party-lewica"><b>Katarzyna Kotula</b></span> has
brought that narrower text back rather than allowing the promise to disappear
into committee. The new division is **[+ partnership_revision_yes +] yes · [+
partnership_revision_no +] no**.

[? if partnership_revision_enacted: The Sejm passes it and **[+ president_name
+]** signs. The compromise is smaller than the status Lewica first sought, but
it is now law and the implementation clock has begun.?]
[? if partnership_revision_passed and not partnership_revision_enacted: The
Sejm passes it; **[+ president_name +]** vetoes even this reduced text. PSL can
no longer describe further narrowing as the obvious route to assent.?]
[? if not partnership_revision_passed: The revised bill fails in the Sejm.
Deputies who asked Lewica to accept less have not supplied the votes even for
less.?]

- @partnership_revision_record

