= July 2026 — Another party and another threshold

**[+ centrum_leader +]**, leader of the wing that lost Poland 2050's succession
fight, and former first vice-chair <span class="party-p2050"><b>Michał Kobosko</b></span> have registered **Unia
Centrum** as a political party. Its **[+ centrum_seats +] MPs** provide speaking
time, staff and committee votes; registration provides a name for a ballot.
Neither proves that the organisation has members and candidates across the
country.

[? if centrum_supports_government: The breakaway still supports the cabinet,
