Q.public_trust += 1;
Q.public_mood_pending_lgbt_equality_support += 8;
Q.public_mood_pending_refugee_solidarity_support += 6;
Q.public_mood_pending_rule_of_law_support += 6;
Q.news_headline = "Specialist teams turn reports into cases";
!}

The cabinet authorises paired police and prosecutor teams with published
charging guidance. Lewica has won the decision, not personal command over
investigators: the serving interior and justice ministers remain accountable
for appointments and cases. Reports now have somewhere specialised to go, and
every failure will carry a ministry's name.

- @poland_event_queue: Take it to cabinet

@hate_opposition_bill
title: Table a specialist-team bill and publish vacancy data
subtitle: From opposition, expose the empty posts and give the cabinet a funded structure it can adopt or reject. Cost: 1 resource.
view-if: left_in_government = 0
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: The parliamentary oversight team cannot be financed.
