# prose-audit: Grade B — Kaczyński, Morawiecki and the named Rozwój+ organisers now move through individual disciplinary files, the live effect on a PiS cabinet is stated, and all three Lewica responses have authored consequences; this remains the middle hearing stage of the larger rupture.
title: PiS disciplinary hearings proceed case by case
subtitle: Kaczyński can expel deputies one by one; Morawiecki still cannot transfer them by declaration
face-image: img/poland/events/jaroslaw-kaczynski-2023.webp
new-page: true
