= September 2026 — Five priorities, one limited budget

Prime Minister **[+ prime_minister +]** asks Finance Minister **[+
finance_minister +]** for a draft that can carry defence, health, local
government, EU fiscal pressure and KPO deadlines at once. **Władysław
Kosiniak-Kamysz** arrives with rural services to protect; every smaller party
is already reading each concession as a line in its 2027 campaign.

[? if horizon_budget_authority: Lewica shares responsibility for a functioning
cabinet, including a PiS-led one if that is the coalition we built. We do not
own the treasury unless Lewica holds the Finance Ministry, but our ministers
and votes can set a red line that the Prime Minister must fund or break.?]
[? if not horizon_budget_authority and caretaker_government: The caretaker can
keep departments operating, not commit its successor to a political 2027
settlement. Lewica's choices become a costed demand for the next confidence
majority.?]
[? if not horizon_budget_authority and not caretaker_government: Lewica is in
opposition. The choices below produce a shadow budget and amendment line; they
do not spend, save or bind state money.?]

- @horizon_social
- @horizon_rural
- @horizon_fiscal

@horizon_social
title: [? if horizon_budget_authority: Announce health, housing and labour enforcement as non-negotiable?][? if not horizon_budget_authority: Publish a costed shadow package for health, housing and labour enforcement?]
subtitle: Put staffed clinics, homes and labour inspectors ahead of coalition comfort, with costs attached.
on-arrival: {!
Q.budget_promises += 4;
Q.party_unity += 3;
Q.labor_credibility += 4;
Q.ko_relation -= 4;
Q.psl_relation -= 3;
if (Q.horizon_budget_authority) Q.fiscal_stress += 4;
else {
    Q.last_policy_stage = "Proposal";
    Q.last_policy_authority = "Opposition shadow budget";
    Q.last_policy_implementation = 0;
}
Q.public_mood_pending_social_spending_support += 8;
Q.public_mood_pending_social_spending_left_ownership += 6;
Q.news_headline = Q.horizon_budget_authority
    ? "The Left enters the budget round with a funded-delivery ultimatum"
    : "Lewica publishes a costed social shadow budget";
!}

[? if horizon_budget_authority: Lewica's ministers place staffing, housing
construction and labour inspection in the coalition's non-negotiable column.
The Finance Minister must now find revenue or breach the fiscal plan; KO and
PSL resent being handed the remaining cuts. The party enters winter united
around something the cabinet can actually fail to deliver.?]
[? if not horizon_budget_authority: Lewica publishes departmental costs,
revenues and the amendments that would move money toward clinics, homes and
inspection. No ministry receives a złoty from a shadow document. Government
parties must answer the package rather than dismiss another unpriced demand.?]

- @poland_event_queue: Enter the column

@horizon_rural
title: [? if horizon_budget_authority: Pre-negotiate a rural-social compact with PSL?][? if not horizon_budget_authority: Negotiate a joint rural-social amendment platform with PSL?]
subtitle: Trade certainty on rural clinics and local finance for PSL support on housing and labour enforcement.
