!}
go-to: snap_first_vote

@snap_left_reject_democratic
title: Withhold confidence and remain full opposition
subtitle: No Lewica votes are added to the nominee's base.
view-if: snap_pm_is_right = 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.snap_left_transfer = 0;
Q.snap_left_abstentions = 0;
Q.snap_left_cabinet_commitment = 0;
Q.party_unity += 1;
Q.ko_relation -= 6;
Q.news_headline =
    "Lewica withholds confidence from the democratic nominee";
!}
go-to: snap_first_vote

@snap_first_vote
title: First-attempt confidence
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
const randomVotes = Math.floor(
    (this.random.uint32() / 4294967296) * 7
) - 3;
Q.snap_first_variance = randomVotes;
Q.confidence_candidate = Q.snap_pm_candidate;
Q.confidence_yes = Math.max(
    0,
    Math.min(
        460,
        Math.round(Number(Q.snap_pm_base) || 0) +
            Math.round(Number(Q.snap_left_transfer) || 0) +
            randomVotes
    )
);
Q.confidence_abstain = Math.max(
    0,
    Math.min(
        460 - Q.confidence_yes,
        60,
        4 + (Number(Q.snap_left_abstentions) || 0)
    )
);
Q.confidence_no = Math.max(
    0,
    460 - Q.confidence_yes - Q.confidence_abstain
);
Q.confidence_present = 460;
Q.confidence_threshold = 231;
Q.government_has_confidence = Q.confidence_yes >= 231 ? 1 : 0;
Q.confidence_mode = "Post-snap presidential first attempt";
!}

= First confidence roll call

**[+ snap_pm_candidate +]: [+ confidence_yes +] yes · [+
confidence_no +] no · [+ confidence_abstain +] abstain**

Yes count: **[+ snap_pm_base +] nominee base** + **[+
snap_left_transfer +] Lewica transfers** + **[+ snap_first_variance +]
roll-call variance**. Threshold: **231**.

- @snap_first_pass
- @snap_sejm_candidate

@snap_first_pass
title: The presidential nominee takes office
view-if: government_has_confidence = 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.prime_minister = Q.snap_pm_candidate;
Q.prime_minister_intro_return = "ministries_or_event_queue";
Q.prime_minister_intro_pending = 1;
Q.government_name = Q.snap_pm_candidate + " cabinet";
Q.government_party = Q.snap_pm_party;
Q.government_owner = Q.snap_pm_is_right
    ? "PiS-led presidential nominee"
    : "KO-led democratic coalition";
Q.left_in_government =
    Q.snap_left_cabinet_commitment ? 1 : 0;
Q.budget = Q.left_in_government ? 3 : 0;
Q.budget_authority = Q.left_in_government
    ? "Post-election coalition reserve"
    : "Opposition — no state spending authority";
Q.position = Q.left_in_government
    ? "Governing coalition"
    : (
        (Number(Q.snap_left_transfer) || 0) > 0
            ? "Confidence-and-supply opposition"
            : "Parliamentary opposition"
    );
Q.coalition_status = "Presidential nominee won confidence";
Q.coalition_seats = Q.government_party == "pis"
    ? Math.max(0, Number(Q.right_committed_seats) || 0)
    : Math.min(
        Number(Q.sejm_total) || 460,
        Math.max(0, Number(Q.democratic_committed_seats) || 0) +
        (Q.left_in_government
            ? Math.max(0, Number(Q.left_seats) || 0)
            : 0)
    );
Q.government_support_seats = Q.snap_pm_is_right
    ? Math.max(0, Number(Q.snap_pm_base) || 0)
    : Math.max(0, Number(Q.democratic_committed_seats) || 0);
Q.caretaker_government = 0;
Q.formation_complete = 1;
Q.formation_in_progress = 0;
Q.snap_election_requested = 0;
Q.left_cabinet_committed = Q.left_in_government ? 1 : 0;
Q.left_cabinet_model = Q.left_in_government
    ? "New Left ministers · Razem external support"
    : (
        (Number(Q.snap_left_transfer) || 0) > 0
            ? "Confidence and supply from opposition"
            : "Opposition"
    );
Q.ministries_finalized = Q.left_in_government ? 0 : 1;
Q.ministry_allocation_mode = Q.left_in_government
    ? "formation"
    : "settled";
Q.ministry_return_mode = "event_queue";
Q.news_headline =
    Q.snap_pm_candidate + " forms the post-election government";
!}
go-to: poland_prime_minister_intro.show

@snap_sejm_candidate
title: The Sejm receives the second attempt
view-if: government_has_confidence = 0
new-page: true

= A democratic candidate needs 231

The President's nominee has failed. The Sejm now chooses its own candidate for
prime minister, and Lewica's support will affect both the nominee and the
coalition assembled around that person.

- @snap_sejm_tusk
- @snap_sejm_trzaskowski
- @snap_sejm_nowacka
- @snap_sejm_sikorski
- @snap_sejm_left

